<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamist militants abducted 14 Islamic school students in Niger State while bandits demanded over ₦100 million ransom for the same abductees. Gunmen attacked a market in north-central Nigeria, killing four civilians and wounding five. A Russian electronic-warfare vehicle was observed operating in Mali, indicating foreign military involvement. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOMzRfekZBR01KNWpMcHpHS245X1ZIaXhxSXgxTmxyekJxWE5QeC1hX25NUHhHcUpVdnctRjBkZlpjcU1PU1EwWEdIWVh0bFBQSlA3ZTlJOWkxU2dGc2JUVFppVG9Ya18za3hWdjR0dUU5eE5vdTlVOURQTl84Rk9Eek9oVkdLZHMwYmxXVi1mMm84NktIdUNmb3l2NA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Military Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE81b2FCcWxBcHZ6WFNUZldUZUVTOWcxeGlEYUlYY0d6OElTbTdwbXFIdWs1c1cxcFVCcWJMc09oNnlyYmlVbXRvekhodFFHWTQ4N3FtdDgxUXl0ZUhuWVRfbXI3OGt3SDJxcmVYUm1ndHNjbmk0VUx2cjRqb1pTdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOWFhRcUN1dVBpMWFQZFR3a3FMWG54YkJGNlZMY3N2MHlzYjVUWVVSNnZPaEVHQkJBNjVGUFloeTNXdGVDd2JyTFdraEZldEMzd0tzMzFUS18zSkVPYXdJXzAtNnZPQXZLQmJDSHNUSkdqNkktOE9lMVBkQllXZl9XdGdnZ3FXcHROMFE0YWg4eTNBcjNUaEtOOGJnc0IwUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOcExjSzBDSHhCVTFUdzNvZUx2NWZ5aDZRczRuNnpFUkZpZ25JLXhKRURFZHZXUTV1dHBIZk1zT2VoNzZuYmJNSHlJZ3NSdjlTbXVhQWFOMFdzTUVxOV9uQjZWNlVUcTN3NmVnaFZLVzVhRDlLbjVFZE9HOGdMTnZMc20xTlpxM3czYVNnVXdURGRlejFwTllhOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Military Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/